        <item>
            <title>3.18.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:00:16 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>203</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.18.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The model provider (Anthropic, DeepSeek, …) is now a chip next to Model in the launcher instead of being hidden in the `+` menu. It appears once a provider is configured in Settings → Providers.
- The `+` menu is gone; "Claude Code on the Web…" moved to the This Mac menu.
- Launcher chips wrap onto a second line in narrow panes instead of overflowing.

### Bug Fixes
- Launcher chip menus now show a checkmark on the current choice.
- Default values (Anthropic, Auto, New session) are shown in grey again, so the choices you made stand out.
]]></description>
